          <code>&lt;Header /&gt;</code>. A single site header — the same logo, nav, and tagline
          render on every page. It's mounted once by the layout shell (see Layout below), so pages
          never import it themselves. The trees backdrop is a background image; on tall viewports (<code
            >min-height: 1024px</code
          >) it anchors to the bottom of the card, and on very short ones (<code
            >max-height: 400px</code
          >) it drops out entirely.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="header-demo"><Header /></div>
    </section>

    <section id="footer" class="section">
